WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:03,610
Scar, take a few people to move the rabbit back to the car.

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,810
At the end of the dungeon, the whole team eats an ostrich feast

3
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:08,210
Yes, have a big meal

4
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:16,100
I can see you guys tried your best.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:19,260
Since God's will cannot be accomplished

6
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,180
Then forget it

7
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,980
Thank you for your generous understanding Fr.

8
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,180
No more solution

9
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:28,800
This arena is suspended in the void

10
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,600
Now you are chosen

11
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,800
Please select the wrestling method you want to participate in

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,200
A.EV1

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,600
B.6V6

14
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,400
C.EV1 becomes three assists

15
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,800
Only extraordinary people can participate in this selection

16
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,400
You will receive special rewards after victory
